DU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":13,"created_at":"2026-04-13T16:59:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T12:19:49Z","closed_at":"2026-05-08T15:05:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118529","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118529","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118529.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118529.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14628\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a new control node called `OutputPanel` that captures and displays engine's log output directly inside a running game. Doing this manually is possible since 4.5 via [Custom Logger](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/logging.html#creating-custom-loggers) but it requires a lot of setup as compared to this built-in drag and drop solution. It supports all the print functions like `print()`, `print_rich()`, `push_error()`, `push_warning()` etc.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af718055-041c-4bad-a249-576eba9c6de4\r\n\r\nIt includes basic properties like Max Lines, Filters (error, warning, standard message) and a Debug Only toggle which ensures that the panel is only visible and functional in debug builds.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"683\" height=\"658\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260413-220745_Godot Engine 4 (debug)\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6cfd84ab-5306-4186-addc-b5b88ebbdbc0\" />\r\n\r\nIt is fully customisable and includes theme overrides like error color, warning colour, standard message color, fonts and the background stylebox.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"684\" height=\"1021\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260413-220844_Godot Engine 4 (debug)\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0854a5c1-9f23-4e96-a1d9-d032ae10e55d\" />","closed_by":{"login":"boycher","id":274249743,"node_id":"U_kgDOEFi4Dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274249743?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher","html_url":"https://github.com/boycher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boycher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118529/reactions","total_count":28,"+1":16,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":7,"confused":0,"heart":4,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118529/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}